<title>Southern Thailand: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/thailand/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-thailand-2026-10-22T13:58:26.528Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 13:58:26 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent attacks continue in the southern insurgency zone, with pipe bombs wounding army officers and security volunteers in Narathiwat and Yala and grenade attacks in Trang. Thai security forces killed suspected drug couriers and seized half a tonne of ice in Phetchaburi, while Chinese nationals were arrested after crossing into Thailand from Laos and a Thai driver and a Lao man were detained for aiding them. The Thai Army proposed sending cadets to China for military training and Thailand announced six trust measures to test Cambodia’s sincerity, while the WTO and multilateral partners reviewed progress on a supply-chain finance initiative. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wto.org/english/news_e/news26_e/trfin_16oct26_517_e.htm&quot;&gt;World Trade Organization&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxOVXdJakVJVkd1dDFCNWdnbFgta2dzamdQWldReHY1NzF3Ny1WdlNIX0t6MDJFSGIzdFdJUWRrNmZDSFBmUVo5N1AwMllIcEVvbFAwNXJXdldSYUdTRkM2RGhKLWs0SjFxSnREZ0tuRGwwcEVRei1iQXVWeWFoTF9ZUExkQzFic0JTQTVCUXpoSUpSV0tZM1paTkJpdDk5dDVDNmZyN2FGb2ZyY2pST29n?oc=5&quot;&gt;Cambodianess&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxQblZxVG8wMzJUV0ViYmZFRU9QcG5BYTdEUHpPeWlEcFg3OXFORVZXQnk5c2VUZXZPT3dqTXItRzNKNG5pem4zR0I4M2l0endZYWl6WXBmbVJ0dzJkZ0VaeTY3ZTd2Y3l5MDRoTlhpUC1vUGUyWmN2Y0Q2NnY3bmxDbmRHd2t3YmhZbjdaRGVqQjM?oc=5&quot;&gt;thetraveler.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxOWDhfMFBncFo5WGRuYzVSZlY4dGhwcjdPZXlhRlJtZzBHS25laUVWZWxxcHBrZ0NHRDBITGxXdzQ5dVpKXzRxNmJVeWhKeEFlSmRFMkZRWlpRbk5SdXlfZ3Q0SE1icFRka2RlZE9GdTZSQUc3U1JMenJhYkM5YTY3SC1BaWpmd3JVVk50bDZqNkJwMVdEb1I0YjFwU1lGaU1SVzhmRWY0ek9BLVdqcngw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://n